# Cold store -- retired graph snapshots and oversized artifacts moved out of the
# working tree by `tools/fs_hygiene.py --kinds graph-snapshots --execute`.
# ~4.6 GB of regenerable data; must never be committed. Same reasoning as
# graphify-out/ above: it is a snapshot of the graph, not a source of truth.
var/

